<h3>五、Known Exploitation</h3>
<p>This vulnerability has been <b>actively exploited</b> since October 22. Known attack vectors:</p>
<ul>
<li>Malicious language server configurations (.vscode/settings.json)</li>
<li>Compromised IDE extensions that connect to crafted LSP servers</li>
<li>CI/CD pipelines that run untrusted language servers during builds</li>
</ul>
<p><b>Recommended immediate action:</b> Block all incoming LSP connections from untrusted sources until you update to 0.20.2.</p>

